    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892020/extras/2ad7079fff19ceb4a39878e1f0238a10.poster.avif?t=1747961237\" width=616 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892020/extras/2ad7079fff19ceb4a39878e1f0238a10.webm?t=1747961237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892020/extras/2ad7079fff19ceb4a39878e1f0238a10.mp4?t=1747961237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892020/extras/3228a0de603506076067038bc660f13d.avif?t=1747961237\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies in each room to unlock your next reward. Survive longer for better rewards  or escape through the next open door if you have to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892020/extras/d22fb3b9e001349c6272f724af2ebf55.poster.avif?t=1747961237\" width=616 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892020/extras/d22fb3b9e001349c6272f724af2ebf55.webm?t=1747961237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892020/extras/d22fb3b9e001349c6272f724af2ebf55.mp4?t=1747961237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892020/extras/977b10cd591775014575c97f49715a34.avif?t=1747961237\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect ability cards, weapons, and trinkets to build a unique character each run. Experiment with different combinations of abilities, buffs and stat upgrades to find powerful synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892020/extras/1ff66716b6f1cb172937a5bd683d697d.poster.avif?t=1747961237\" width=616 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892020/extras/1ff66716b6f1cb172937a5bd683d697d.webm?t=1747961237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892020/extras/1ff66716b6f1cb172937a5bd683d697d.mp4?t=1747961237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892020/extras/77444c5724c4621744e330212c590070.avif?t=1747961237\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete elite encounters, quests and world events to obtain unique rewards. Choose between story driven challenges and randomized adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892020/extras/9a54b5d48b966054d7dda090b10dd7ac.poster.avif?t=1747961237\" width=616 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892020/extras/9a54b5d48b966054d7dda090b10dd7ac.webm?t=1747961237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892020/extras/9a54b5d48b966054d7dda090b10dd7ac.mp4?t=1747961237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892020/extras/58f9e1883f20bec267569f9cd5d1e78c.avif?t=1747961237\" width=616 height=100 /></span>Face powerful bosses in multi-stage fights that test both player skill and character build. Defeat them to claim their land for your ever growing civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892020/extras/92808e0289a7dbec9b4b164378ddae3c.poster.avif?t=1747961237\" width=616 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892020/extras/92808e0289a7dbec9b4b164378ddae3c.webm?t=1747961237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892020/extras/92808e0289a7dbec9b4b164378ddae3c.mp4?t=1747961237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892020/extras/da5bf78a1a98b9574c0081747f6078f9.avif?t=1747961237\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new territories with each run. Build improvements to benefit your characters on their journeys. Grow your civilization stronger to capture more territories and unlock new challenges.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892020/extras/53a8ec73e66cc159bc8d4464cc80c4f4.avif?t=1747961237\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892020/extras/2ad7079fff19ceb4a39878e1f0238a10.poster.avif?t=1747961237\" width=616 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892020/extras/2ad7079fff19ceb4a39878e1f0238a10.webm?t=1747961237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892020/extras/2ad7079fff19ceb4a39878e1f0238a10.mp4?t=1747961237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892020/extras/3228a0de603506076067038bc660f13d.avif?t=1747961237\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies in each room to unlock your next reward. Survive longer for better rewards  or escape through the next open door if you have to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892020/extras/d22fb3b9e001349c6272f724af2ebf55.poster.avif?t=1747961237\" width=616 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892020/extras/d22fb3b9e001349c6272f724af2ebf55.webm?t=1747961237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892020/extras/d22fb3b9e001349c6272f724af2ebf55.mp4?t=1747961237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892020/extras/977b10cd591775014575c97f49715a34.avif?t=1747961237\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect ability cards, weapons, and trinkets to build a unique character each run. Experiment with different combinations of abilities, buffs and stat upgrades to find powerful synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892020/extras/1ff66716b6f1cb172937a5bd683d697d.poster.avif?t=1747961237\" width=616 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892020/extras/1ff66716b6f1cb172937a5bd683d697d.webm?t=1747961237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892020/extras/1ff66716b6f1cb172937a5bd683d697d.mp4?t=1747961237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892020/extras/77444c5724c4621744e330212c590070.avif?t=1747961237\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete elite encounters, quests and world events to obtain unique rewards. Choose between story driven challenges and randomized adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892020/extras/9a54b5d48b966054d7dda090b10dd7ac.poster.avif?t=1747961237\" width=616 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892020/extras/9a54b5d48b966054d7dda090b10dd7ac.webm?t=1747961237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892020/extras/9a54b5d48b966054d7dda090b10dd7ac.mp4?t=1747961237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892020/extras/58f9e1883f20bec267569f9cd5d1e78c.avif?t=1747961237\" width=616 height=100 /></span>Face powerful bosses in multi-stage fights that test both player skill and character build. Defeat them to claim their land for your ever growing civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892020/extras/92808e0289a7dbec9b4b164378ddae3c.poster.avif?t=1747961237\" width=616 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892020/extras/92808e0289a7dbec9b4b164378ddae3c.webm?t=1747961237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892020/extras/92808e0289a7dbec9b4b164378ddae3c.mp4?t=1747961237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892020/extras/da5bf78a1a98b9574c0081747f6078f9.avif?t=1747961237\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new territories with each run. Build improvements to benefit your characters on their journeys. Grow your civilization stronger to capture more territories and unlock new challenges.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892020/extras/53a8ec73e66cc159bc8d4464cc80c4f4.avif?t=1747961237\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p>",
